1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,560
In 1905, an Italian teacher got so fed up with his students that he snapped.

2
00:00:04,587 --> 00:00:07,360
So he invented the ultimate punishment: homework.

3
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:12,320
His name was Roberto Nevilis, and his idea spread across the entire world.

4
00:00:12,347 --> 00:00:13,640
It's the perfect story.

5
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,400
But almost none of it is actually true.

6
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:20,320
And the real reason you have homework is far stranger than any punishment.

7
00:00:20,388 --> 00:00:22,000
The full story is on Second Glance.

